//      keep animating. Jay 2026-09-28: "If we DRIVE the animations, we shouldn't need to FIGHT them." (AnimHoldUpper)
//      tree=INERT. DEFAULT OFF. Clears bit 9 (rotation write-enable) of each element's EntityInfo flags dword
//      (E+0x1908, entry+0x08) - NOT the u16 gate (D-11/D-32/D-81, INV-41's ordinal shift), NOT dst=-1 (D-34), NOT
//      Block(i) (D-26). The element then HOLDS the rotation its pose state (E+0x1920) had on the arming frame, and
//      d7380 still rebuilds its local from that state every frame. ARMS ONLY AFTER the ANIMHOLD observer has seen the player's
//      own d7380 JobData read THIS map and no other character read it (a shared map would freeze NPCs too).
//      Restores exactly the bits it cleared on switch-off. Needs diag_bone_blend_probe (the tick + the d7380 detour)
//      and diag_bone_dump (the captured model); NOT the rig, NOT controllers - so it runs in FLAT.
