// depends on the rig's own axis convention, which is not documented anywhere and
// is a coin flip. If the two motions come out swapped in the headset, this is the
// fix; if one is merely INVERTED, swap the paired limits above instead - no
// rebuild needed either way.
bool  RigWristSwapAxes       = true;
